      "voiceName": "Trevor Noah",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "How the music industry is faking viral success.\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/Trevornoah/status/2057644363891560460",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-22T02:07:00+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "trevor-noah",
      "voiceName": "Trevor Noah",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "I was bombing in Los Angeles until @KattWilliams  started laughing from the balcony like he was dying laughing...\n\nWatch the full story on my YouTube channel now!\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/Trevornoah/status/2057502932388446250",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-21T16:45:00+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "trevor-noah",
      "voiceName": "Trevor Noah",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Mandela knew every word, every image, and every moment could shape how the world remembered the fight.\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/Trevornoah/status/2057324424257540375",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-21T04:55:40+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "trevor-noah",
      "voiceName": "Trevor Noah",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "At some point, forgiveness stops being about changing the past. \n\nIt becomes about accepting people for who they were\u2026 and deciding how you move forward.\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/Trevornoah/status/2057148345639178737",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-20T17:16:00+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "trevor-noah",
      "voiceName": "Trevor Noah",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "If I ruled the world...\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/Trevornoah/status/2056959234714243396",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-20T04:44:32+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "trevor-noah",
      "voiceName": "Trevor Noah",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "One of my favorite things is hearing how people learned to navigate different worlds. \n\nLupita describing language learning as \u201csurvival mode\u201d honestly makes perfect sense to me.\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/Trevornoah/status/2056778911237988575",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-19T16:48:00+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "trevor-noah",
      "voiceName": "Trevor Noah",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "\"More Chinese believe in a China dream today than Americans believe in America...\"\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/Trevornoah/status/2056549360239083682",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-19T01:35:50+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "trevor-noah",
      "voiceName": "Trevor Noah",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Kareem Rahma explains how Subway Takes filters out people who are clearly trying too hard to create a viral moment.\n\nWatch the full conversation on my YouTube channel.\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/Trevornoah/status/2056418788304691401",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-18T16:57:00+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "trevor-noah",
      "voiceName": "Trevor Noah",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "A lot of people don\u2019t vote based on facts. \n\nThey vote based on whether someone makes them feel seen.\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/Trevornoah/status/2056238507606348089",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-18T05:00:37+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "trevor-noah",
      "voiceName": "Trevor Noah",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Maybe people don\u2019t miss agreement.\n\nMaybe they miss being able to disagree without hating each other.\n\nFull episode on YouTube.\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/Trevornoah/status/2056054639070728377",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-17T16:50:00+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "trevor-noah",
      "voiceName": "Trevor Noah",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "People in Stockholm were stopping me like:\n\n\u201cCan\u2019t wait for your show tonight!\u201d\n\nAnd I was thinking:\n\u201cDamn\u2026 my fanbase in Sweden is incredible.\u201d\nTurns out The Weeknd was in town.\n\nFull episode on YouTube.\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/Trevornoah/status/2055690489467142443",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-16T16:43:00+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
